      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s downtown waterfront hosts a performing arts center, art galleries, and public parks that reflect its “soul” according to local descriptions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
